        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid to complete each level by activating and stepping onto all goal cells. A goal activates only when the carried piece\u2019s shape, color, and rotation exactly match that goal\u2019s required attributes; completing all goals advances to the next level, and finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs 1 stamina; when stamina hits 0 you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Movement is constrained by walls, represented each turn by a list of blocked_directions that must never be chosen. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape changers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color changers cycle colors in order orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation changers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise (0\u219290\u2192180\u2192270\u21920). Goals are completed by stepping onto the goal cell while the piece matches its required shape/color/rotation."
